@startuml Pagelas Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Pagelas — scoped weekly records

actor "Admin / Coordinator / Teacher" as Client
participant PagelasController as Controller
participant "Create / Get / Update / Delete PagelasService" as Service
participant ResolvePagelaWeekService as Week
database "MySQL\nPagelasRepository" as Repository

Client -> Controller : list, detail or mutation
Controller -> Service : DTO/query + role access context

alt Create or change reference date
  Service -> Repository : verify child is within caller reach
  Repository --> Service : allowed or denied
  Service -> Week : resolve academic year/week from period
  Week --> Service : academic week or date-range error
end

Service -> Repository : scoped query, create, update or delete
Repository --> Service : entity/page or not-found
Service --> Client : PagelaResponseDto / shared page / message

note over Week, Repository
  One pagela per child and academic week is database-enforced.
  Out-of-scope records look not found on reads.
end note
@enduml
